'''X Speed''' (Japanese: '''スピーダー''' ''Speeder'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=During this turn, the Retreat Cost of your Active Pokémon is 1 less.
}}

==Release information==
X Speed cards were first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each. One copy of X Speed is also awarded to players who complete the {{TCGP|Mission|mission}} "08: Play an Item card!" in the {{DL|Mission (TCG Pocket)|Battle Guide}}.

==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Leaf}} has a more potent version of this card's effect, but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an Item card.
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Air Balloon}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card is an Item card rather than a {{TCG|Pokémon Tool}} card (so only applies for one turn rather than perpetually) and reduces the Pokémon's Retreat Cost by 1 instead of 2.

===Origin===
* [[X Speed]] is an item in the [[Pokémon games]] that temporarily boosts a Pokémon's {{Stat|Speed}} stat when used during battle. This card depicts an X Speed as it appears in the majority of [[core series]] games.

